.TH METIS 1 "August 2026" "Metis 4.5.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
metis \- pure Common Lisp hybrid mind with dual\-facet sealed symbols and house chat spine
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B metis
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIargs\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Metis is an empty Common Lisp cognitive runtime (version
.BR 4.5.0 ).
Load dual\-facet sealed symbols (math process+knowledge, language use+about)
on demand. Residual freeform uses an in\-process house language model;
product freeform does not call external LLM APIs.
.PP
Default invocation starts the full\-screen TUI. Requires
.B SBCL
and
.B Quicklisp
on PATH for Lisp modes.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B (default)
Full\-screen TUI (chat | symbols | REPL popups).
.TP
.B chat
Line interface without TUI.
.TP
.B version
Print version string from the package tree (and live Lisp when available).
.TP
.B test
Run the in\-tree FiveAM suite.
.TP
.B symbol
Train, seal, verify, and load knowledge symbol packages.
.TP
.B epoch
Multi\-session open pursuit continuum.
.TP
.B help
Show launcher help.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B METIS_ROOT
Package tree root (installed
.I share/metis
or git checkout).
.TP
.B CL_SOURCE_REGISTRY
ASDF/Quicklisp source registry; the launcher prepends
.BR METIS_ROOT .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/metis
Default install tree (via
.BR install.sh ).
.TP
.I ~/.metis/
User symbols, trust keys, pack registry.
.SH INSTALL
.nf
curl -fsSL https://metis.f00.sh/install.sh | bash
# pin: METIS_VERSION=4.5.0
brew install f00-sh/tap/metis
# AUR: packaging/aur or f00-sh/aur-metis
.fi
